{"id":"4d33bbc4aed8d359","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-descriptive3-rank-function.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive3 Rank Function","display":"df-zfc-descriptive3-rank-function — ZFC Descriptive3 Rank Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive3-rank-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive3-rank-function"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive3-rank-function — ZFC Descriptive3 Rank Function","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-topology]]","[[58-df-borel]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive3-rank-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive3-rank-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive3-rank-function — ZFC Descriptive3 Rank Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"58-df-topology\">58-df-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"58-df-borel\">58-df-borel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Borel}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Borel}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Top}\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\operatorname{Top}\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3RankFunction}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3RankFunction}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\tau,\\rho\\in V\">\\(A,\\tau,\\rho\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}\\)</span> (topology predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"58-df-topology\">58-df-topology</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}\\)</span> (Borel-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"58-df-borel\">58-df-borel</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3RankFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3RankFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}rank\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3RankFunction}_S(A,\\tau,\\rho)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,A)\\land\\exists B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,A,B)\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\rho(x))\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\mathrm{Borel}(\\{x\\in A\\mid\\rho(x)\\leq\\alpha\\},A,\\tau)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}rank\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3RankFunction}_S(A,\\tau,\\rho)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,A)\\land\\exists B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,A,B)\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\rho(x))\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\mathrm{Borel}(\\{x\\in A\\mid\\rho(x)\\leq\\alpha\\},A,\\tau)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The rank graph is now a typed set function with a set codomain; merely assigning it a domain did not ensure functionality.  The proper class of ordinals is not used as an exponent or a bounded-quantifier domain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topology","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-borel","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-borel]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topology","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Top}$ (topology predicate, see [[58-df-topology]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-borel","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Borel}$ (Borel-set predicate, see [[58-df-borel]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Borel}\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Top}\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3RankFunction}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"A,\\tau,\\rho\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3RankFunction}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}rank\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3RankFunction}_S(A,\\tau,\\rho)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,A)\\land\\exists B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,A,B)\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\rho(x))\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\mathrm{Borel}(\\{x\\in A\\mid\\rho(x)\\leq\\alpha\\},A,\\tau)\\Bigr)","d